  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: "I\u2019ve been standing here since the sun came up. This is the life,
      man. No boss, no work, just vibes."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "So... you\u2019re just a professional timer-waster?"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: "It\u2019s called \"enjoying youth,\" bro. You wouldn't get it, always
      sweating on that rusty bike just to make a few coins."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: At least my bike is actually moving, unlike you.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Tuan Anh (Mayor's Son)
    Text: "Whatever, man. I\u2019m living my best life while you\u2019re just a servant
      for a parcel."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
